fixture walk_down_ramp45_onto_crest_lip
doc Physics review 8 (BUILD.md s5 Ground, corner correction: on the ground the 8 u nudge steps the player up onto a lip, such as a door left open as a floor). Walk left from the plateau down the 45-degree ramp of test/ramp45_crest_lip into the face of the door laid 4 u below the plateau: the leading edge meets it with the centre at x 183, the feet at y 201 and the door's top 5 u above them, and the walk steps up onto the door and runs on along it to the room's edge, 9 u every tick. Before the fix the lift was measured to the plateau the trailing foot zone still rested in, 9 u above the feet, past the 8 u nudge, and the player stood at the door's face for good.
room test/ramp45_crest_lip
spawn 300 192
frames 40
